.TH sparsemap 7 "2026-05-13" "sparsemap 1.0.0" "Sparsemap Concepts"
.SH NAME
sparsemap \- conceptual overview of the sparsemap compressed bitmap
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sparsemap is a sparse, compressed bitmap library.  Best case stores
2048 bits in 8 bytes via run-length encoding; worst case is
uncompressed (2048 bits + 8 bytes overhead).  Three-tier hierarchy:
bit vectors, chunks (sparse or RLE), and a top-level map of chunks.
See \fIdocs/ARCHITECTURE.md\fR in the source distribution for the
full design.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sparsemap (3)
